// ============================================================================
// Interactions in the middle tiers: one knot per interactable or person in src/data/areas/middleTiers.ts.
// Day-specific scenes divert to the day files; the rest is draft text for the designer to rewrite.
// ============================================================================

=== middle_guard ===
"Roots? Then you'll need to be sent for. Nobody goes up without a reason." #speaker:post_guard
-> END

=== middle_carver ===
"Mind the shelves. Each of those took a season." He looks at your hand, then away. "The best go up the tube, of course." #speaker:carver
-> END

=== middle_lift_keeper ===
"The lift's for those who can pay. The stairs are free, if your legs are." #speaker:lift_keeper
-> END

=== middle_workshop ===
Shelves of carved figures, finer than anything you've made. Every chisel has its place. Nobody here has ever slipped.
-> END

=== middle_tube_view ===
The tube, close enough to feel its cold light. Up here it seems brighter, as if it likes these people better.
-> END

=== middle_clock ===
A blessing that ticks. Its hands creep round, and the family who owns it tells everyone the time.
-> END

// Day 5: the escort, following you up.
=== middle_escort ===
"Keep moving." #speaker:escort
-> END
